title: Restored fundings.
subtitle: [? if ethics_hate = 2 : The O5 has restored our funds. ?][? if ethics_hate >= 3 : The O5 is restoring our funding. ?]
on-arrival: ethics_timer += 2
on-departure: funding += 1; ethics_hate -= 1
tags: event
view-if: ethics_hate >= 2 and ethics_committee_relation >= 75
priority: -1

The Ethics Committee has seen our corrective measures and are pleased.

They have informed the Council about us and the Council have decided to restore our funds bit by bit.
